    {
      "id": "m-004",
      "type": "mcq",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "id": "m-005",
          "text": {
            "en": [
              {
                "text": "Which of the following will shift the demand curve for tablet computers to the right?"
              }
            ],
            "zh": [
              {
                "text": "以下哪項會令平板電腦的需求曲線向右移？"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "marks": 1,
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "m-006",
          "text": {
            "en": [
              {
                "text": "(1) only"
              }
            ],
            "zh": [
              {
                "text": "只有 (1)"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "m-007",
          "text": {
            "en": [
              {
                "text": "(2) only"
              }
            ],
            "zh": [
              {
                "text": "只有 (2)"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "m-008",
          "text": {
            "en": [
              {
                "text": "(1) and (2) only"
              }
            ],
            "zh": [
              {
                "text": "只有 (1) 和 (2)"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "m-009",
          "text": {
            "en": [
              {
                "text": "(1), (2) and (3)"
              }
            ],
            "zh": [
              {
                "text": "(1)、(2) 和 (3)"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "answerIndex": 1,
      "optionLayout": "columns2"
    },
    {
      "id": "m-010",
      "type": "mcq",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "id": "m-011",
          "text": {
            "en": [
              {
                "text": "Income rises. For a normal good, what happens to the equilibrium price and quantity?"
              }
            ],
            "zh": [
              {
                "text": "收入上升。對於正常物品，均衡價格和數量會有甚麼變化？"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "marks": 1,
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "m-012",
          "text": {
            "en": [
              {
                "text": "Price rises, quantity rises"
              }
            ],
            "zh": [
              {
                "text": "價格上升，數量上升"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "m-013",
          "text": {
            "en": [
              {
                "text": "Price rises, quantity falls"
              }
            ],
            "zh": [
              {
                "text": "價格上升，數量下降"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "m-014",
          "text": {
            "en": [
              {
                "text": "Price falls, quantity rises"
              }
            ],
            "zh": [
              {
                "text": "價格下降，數量上升"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "m-015",
          "text": {
            "en": [
              {
                "text": "Price falls, quantity falls"
              }
            ],
            "zh": [
              {
                "text": "價格下降，數量下降"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "answerIndex": 1,
      "optionLayout": "inline"
    },
    {
      "id": "m-016",
      "type": "mcq",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "id": "m-017",
          "text": {
            "en": [
              {
                "text": "A price ceiling is set below the equilibrium price. Why does a shortage result?"
              }
            ],
            "zh": [
              {
                "text": "價格上限定於均衡價格以下。為甚麼會出現短缺？"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "marks": 1,
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "m-018",
          "text": {
            "en": [
              {
                "text": "The quantity demanded rises while the quantity supplied falls"
              }
            ],
            "zh": [
              {
                "text": "需求量上升，而供應量下降"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "m-019",
          "text": {
            "en": [
              {
                "text": "Producers are not allowed to charge more than the legal price"
              }
            ],
            "zh": [
              {
                "text": "生產者不得以高於法定價格出售"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "m-020",
          "text": {
            "en": [
              {
                "text": "The government removes the tax on the good completely"
              }
            ],
            "zh": [
              {
                "text": "政府完全取消該貨品的稅項"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "m-021",
          "text": {
            "en": [
              {
                "text": "The government pays a subsidy to the producers of the good"
              }
            ],
            "zh": [
              {
                "text": "政府向該貨品的生產者發放津貼"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "answerIndex": 1
    },
